{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01580","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十四拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十四拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫以胡儿可羞耻，恩情亦各言其子。\n手中十指有长短，截之痛惜皆相似。\n还乡岂不见亲族，念此飘零隔生死。\n南风万里吹我心，心亦随风渡辽水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}